    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS ... are delighted to present an outstanding 3-bedroom extended semi-detached family home spanning approx. 122 m² / 1313 ft²  on two levels. This wondeful house was constructed in the early 1970's when generous living spaces was the style of the era and No. 20 is surrounded by numerous shops and local amenities nearby in Santry Village. The much-anticipated release of this property to the market represents a wonderful opportunity to purchase a spacious home set in a well-established Santry location that is in good condition throughout and requires modernisation. This property would be ideal for the professional family wishing to put their own touch to a spacious home located on the very edge of Santry village, with every amenity nearby.\r\n\r\nThere is a welcoming entrance hall on the ground floor with a spacious dining room to the front that interconnects with the rear family living room. The kitchen and breakfast room overlooks the rear east facing garden which is very private, wide and extends to over 50ft long. The former garage has been converted to create a versatile additional space, ideal for use as a home office, playroom or potentially a 4th bedroom, subject to the purchaser’s requirements. Upstairs on the first floor consists of 3 spacious bedrooms - two large double rooms and a generous single bedroom. There is a spacious family bathroom off the landing with attic access from the main landing area. The attics are easily converted and offer the new owners additional bedroom space or a home office opportunity.\r\n\r\nThe East facing rear 50ft garden is paved and lawned, with mature trees giving the new owners ample space to extend subject to P.P.  There is also off-street parking to the front. The new owners will certainly modernise and extend the home as No. 20 simply oozes great potential for the next generation. \r\n\r\nThe location of this property is second to none and enjoys all the features that are expected from such a fine residence in a private estate that enjoys the benefit of a private parkland for children to enjoy. Situated in the heart of Santry, 20 Santry Close benefits from immediate access to every conceivable amenity. The Omni Park Shopping Centre that also features a cinema, major supermarkets, retail shops and restaurants is just minutes’ walk away. In addition, Santry is home to the Crown Plaza Hotel, several restaurants, multiple gymnasiums, a track and field stadium and a national sports injury clinic. Beaumont Hospital and DCU are located close by also. Dublin Airport is a 10-minute drive, and the area is also well served by public transport and is close to the M50 and the M1. The beautiful grounds of Santry Demense are directly opposite where over 70 acres are on your doorstep to enjoy and appreciate at your leisure. \r\n\r\nEarly viewing is essential to appreciate all this wonderful home has to offer and by appointment with MOVEHOME ESTATE AGENTS 01-88 44 690"
      },
